*> vybe-test: cobol/declaratives_use_sections/declaratives_with_call_runtime
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_declaratives_use_sections.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
01 WS-FILE PIC X(1) VALUE "A".
01 WS-RESULT PIC X(5) VALUE SPACES.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
DECLARATIVES.
D2 SECTION.
    USE AFTER STANDARD ERROR PROCEDURE ON WS-FILE.
END DECLARATIVES.
MAIN-SEC SECTION.
    MOVE "OK" TO WS-RESULT.
    DISPLAY WS-RESULT
    STOP RUN.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-RESULT DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "OK"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [OK] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.

